  <iati-identifier>XM-DAC-41123-PROJECT-170086</iati-identifier>
  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-41123" type="40">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">United Nations Industrial Development Organization</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to mechanized agriculture systems in Ethiopia (Amhara Regional State)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In response to the high youth unemployment and lack of mechanized agriculture in the Amhara Regional State, the Organization for Reh abilitation and Development in Amhara (ORDA) and the regional government has requested UNIDO for project technical support in modernizing the horticultural sectors through establishing #pilot modern value chain approach to horticulture based Agro-enterprise development# project in Koga Irrigation Scheme area in West Amhara. The purpose was to introduce appropriate agricultural mechanization technologies, postharvest technologies, product certification and adapting sustainable market linkages in the horticulture sector in the region. The project concept was also in line with the national agenda for agricultural transformation through adoption of demand driven agricultural production systems. The project will also have a replicable benefit to promote the Integrated Agro-industrial Park development in West Amhara.</narrative>
  </description>
